{"sha": "c4b1d6674cd70fd6f10ee882701ea049076447ff36ca9664a80b00735c66a507", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % network: E1=10V, R1=1k ; E2=5V, R2=2k ; common load R3=2k", "  \\draw (0,0) to[battery1, l=$E_1$, invert] (0,2) to[R=$R_1$] (2.5,2) -- (2.5,2) to[R=$R_3$, v=$u$] (2.5,0) -- (0,0);", "  \\draw (2.5,2) to[R=$R_2$] (5,2) to[battery1, l_=$E_2$] (5,0) -- (2.5,0);", "  \\node at (2.5,2.45) {$N$};", "  \\node at (6.4,1) {$\\Longleftrightarrow$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.8cm]", "  \\draw (0,0) to[battery1, l=$E_{\\mathrm{Th}}$, invert] (0,2) to[R=$R_{\\mathrm{Th}}$] (2.2,2) to[R=$R_3$, v=$u$] (2.2,0) -- (0,0);", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个电源向公共负载 $R_3$ 供电。从 $R_3$ 两端看去，", "电路其余部分等效为戴维南电源", "（$E_{\\mathrm{Th}}$，$R_{\\mathrm{Th}}$）；由米尔曼定理可一步求得", "节点 $N$ 的电势。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[同一结果的三种求法]\\label{ex:b1:dc-circuits:threeways}", "图中 $E_1 = \\qty{10}{V}$，$R_1 = \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm}$，$E_2 =", "\\qty{5.0}{V}$，$R_2 = \\qty{2.0}{k\\ohm}$，$R_3 = \\qty{2.0}{k\\ohm}$。", "\\emph{米尔曼}：$V_N = (10/1 + 5/2 + 0/2)/(1 + 0.5 + 0.5) = 12.5/2 =", "\\qty{6.25}{V}$。\\emph{叠加}：仅 $E_1$ 作用时，$R_2 \\parallel", "R_3 = \\qty{1}{k\\ohm}$，故 $u = 10 \\times 1/2 = \\qty{5}{V}$；仅 $E_2$ 作用时，", "$R_1 \\parallel R_3 = \\qty{0.667}{k\\ohm}$，$u = 5 \\times 0.667/2.667", "= \\qty{1.25}{V}$；合计 \\qty{6.25}{V}。\\emph{戴维南}：从", "$R_3$ 处看去：$E_{\\mathrm{Th}}$ 为分压器", "$(E_1, R_1, R_2, E_2)$ 的开路电压：$E_2 + (E_1 - E_2)R_2/(R_1 + R_2) = 5 + 5 \\times", "2/3 = \\qty{8.33}{V}$；$R_{\\mathrm{Th}} = R_1 \\parallel R_2 =", "\\qty{0.667}{k\\ohm}$；于是 $u = 8.33 \\times 2/2.667 = \\qty{6.25}{V}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{工作点；惠斯通电桥}", "", "\\begin{method}[图解法求工作点]\\label{met:b1:dc-circuits:loadline}", "\\index{工作点}\\index{负载线}", "非线性二端元件（伏安关系 $i = g(u)$）由戴维南电源", "$(E, R)$ 供电时，两个关系同时成立之处即为其工作状态：画出二端元件的", "伏安特性曲线与电源的\\emph{负载线} $u = E - Ri$ 画在同一坐标轴上，", "二者的交点即为\\emph{工作点}。设计", "发光二极管的串联电阻、稳压二极管的稳压电路或晶体管的偏置，", "正是这一作图过程。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8cm, height=5.4cm, xlabel={$u$ (\\unit{V})}, ylabel={$i$ (\\unit{mA})},", "    xmin=0, xmax=5.6, ymin=0, ymax=30, xtick={1,2,3,4,5}, ytick={10,20,25}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1.9, samples=2] {0};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=1.9:2.9, samples=60] {28*(exp(2.8*(x-1.9))-1)/(exp(2.8)-1)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:5, samples=2] {25 - 5*x};", "  \\fill[omExo] (axis cs:2.0,15) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\node[omExo, font=\\footnotesize] (op) at (axis cs:1.05,11.5) {工作点};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omExo] (op.east) -- (axis cs:1.93,14.8);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize, left] at (axis cs:2.55,25) {发光二极管};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (axis cs:3.1,1.4) {负载线};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 发光二极管（开启电压约 \\qty{2}{V}）由 $E = \\qty{5}{V}$ 经", "$R = \\qty{200}{\\ohm}$ 供电：负载线 $u = E - Ri$ 与", "二极管的伏安特性曲线交于 $\\qty{2.0}{V}$、\\qty{15}{mA} 处。增大 $R$", "会使负载线向下倾斜，发光二极管变暗。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[惠斯通电桥]\\label{prop:b1:dc-circuits:wheatstone}", "\\index{惠斯通电桥}", "四个电阻 $R_1, R_2$（一条支路）与 $R_3, R_4$（另一条支路）接在", "电源 $E$ 两端，电桥输出为两中点间的", "电压：", "\\[", "u = E\\left(\\frac{R_2}{R_1 + R_2} - \\frac{R_4}{R_3 + R_4}\\right),", "\\]", "输出为零（此时电桥称为\\emph{平衡}的）的充要条件是 $R_1R_4 = R_2R_3$。对于", "平衡电桥，若 $R_4$ 变为 $R_4(1 + \\epsilon)$，$\\epsilon", "\\ll 1$，且 $R_3 = R_4$，则 $u \\approx -E\\epsilon/4$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "两个分压器作差。平衡条件：$R_2(R_3 + R_4) = R_4(R_1 +", "R_2)$，即 $R_2R_3 = R_1R_4$。取 $R_3 = R_4 = R$，$R_1 = R_2$，则", "$u = E[\\tfrac12 - (1 + \\epsilon)/(2 + \\epsilon)] = E[(2 + \\epsilon - 2 -", "2\\epsilon)/(2(2 + \\epsilon))] \\approx -E\\epsilon/4$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,1.5) to[R=$R_1$] (2,3) to[R=$R_2$] (4,1.5) to[R=$R_4$] (2,0) to[R=$R_3$] (0,1.5);", "  \\draw (2,3) to[short, *-] (2,3); \\draw (2,0) to[short, *-] (2,0);", "  \\draw (0,1.5) -- (-1,1.5) to[battery1, l=$E$] (-1,-1) -- (4,-1) -- (4,1.5);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (2,0.35) -- (2,2.65) ;", "  \\node[omThm, right] at (2.05,1.5) {$u$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 惠斯通电桥：两个分压电路并排放置。电桥平衡时", "$R_1R_4 = R_2R_3$，它能把某一电阻的微小变化（应变片、热敏电阻）", "转换为接近零的电压，", "这比放大大电压上的微小变化容易得多。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:dc-circuits:1}", "手机以 \\qty{1.5}{A} 的电流充电一小时：流过的电荷量是多少，", "有多少个电子通过？估算下列情形中准稳态近似是否成立：", "频率为 \\qty{50}{Hz} 的家庭线路、长 \\qty{10}{cm} 的电路在 \\qty{1}{MHz} 时，", "以及同一电路在 \\qty{1}{GHz} 时。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:dc-circuits:2}", "\\qty{2000}{W} 的电热器接在 \\qty{230}{V} 电源上：求其电流、电阻，以及", "在 \\qty{3.0}{h} 内消耗的能量（分别以 kWh 和焦耳表示）。其 \\qty{5.0}{m} 长的铜导线", "横截面积为 \\qty{1.5}{mm^2}（$\\rho = \\qty{1.7e-8}{\\ohm.m}$），求", "导线上损耗的功率。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}